<%- include('partials/head') %>

<section class="hiw-hero">
  <p class="hiw-step-label">The full picture</p>
  <h1>One platform. Everything you need<br>to stop thinking and start building.</h1>
  <p class="lead">NoBossly walks you from raw potential to a running business &mdash; with AI doing the heavy lifting and a community keeping you honest.</p>
  <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:1.5rem">
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/signup">Start free &rarr;</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single" style="margin-top:2rem">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 1</p>
    <h2>&#x1F9E0; Tell us who you are</h2>
    <p class="muted">A five-step founder questionnaire &mdash; about 10 minutes &mdash; that feeds the AI everything it needs to match ideas to <em>your</em> real life. Not generic startup advice. Yours.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Identity &amp; background</strong> &mdash; your field, credentials, location, and work status</li>
      <li><strong>Skills &amp; passions</strong> &mdash; what you&rsquo;re good at, what energises you, what you&rsquo;d pay to talk about for free</li>
      <li><strong>Work style</strong> &mdash; solo or team, AI-native or sceptic, risk appetite, hours per week you can actually commit</li>
      <li><strong>Resources</strong> &mdash; launch budget, runway, income target for year one, preferred business models</li>
      <li><strong>Experience &amp; motivation</strong> &mdash; prior attempts, sales comfort, target customer, your real reason for wanting this</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted small">Your answers are stored and used to generate ideas and your launch blueprint. You can return and update them any time.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 2</p>
    <h2>&#x1F4A1; Get four AI-matched business ideas</h2>
    <p class="muted">One click runs the AI and returns four business ideas built around who you actually are &mdash; not a list of trending niches.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Each idea includes a <strong>success likelihood score</strong>, demand rating, and passion-fit score</li>
      <li>Startup cost estimate (lean build) and <strong>time-to-first-revenue</strong> window</li>
      <li>Market and competitor framing so you know exactly what you&rsquo;re walking into</li>
      <li>Niche and mainstream options so you can choose your lane</li>
      <li>Star favourites to keep them at the top</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted small">The free plan includes one generation. Paid plans unlock unlimited regenerations.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="align-self:center;padding:1.5rem">
    <span class="tag">SaaS</span>
    <h3 style="margin:.6rem 0 .25rem">Example Idea Name</h3>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:0 0 .9rem">A short tagline explaining the business in one line.</p>
    <div class="scores">
      <span class="chip">&#x1F3AF; 82% success</span>
      <span class="chip">&#x1F4C8; demand 8/10</span>
      <span class="chip">&#x2764;&#xFE0F; passion 9/10</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:.6rem 0 0">&#x23F1; Revenue in 3&ndash;6 months &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; &#x1F4B0; from $500 lean</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 3</p>
    <h2>&#x1F4D0; Build your complete launch blueprint</h2>
    <p class="muted">Pick an idea and NoBossly generates a full business plan &mdash; not a template with blanks to fill, but a real strategy document written for your specific business.</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1rem">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Positioning &amp; pitch</h4>
        <p class="muted small">A ready-to-use positioning statement, elevator pitch, and the differentiators that separate you from competitors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Ideal customer profile</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Your ICP archetype, demographics, pain points, and exactly where to find them &mdash; specific forums, communities, and platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Revenue model &amp; pricing</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Recommended revenue type with rationale, plus tiered pricing with what each tier includes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Revenue projections</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Month 3, Month 6, and Month 12 revenue targets so you know what you&rsquo;re building toward.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Go-to-market strategy</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Specific channels with effort ratings, how to land your first paying customer, and a week-one action checklist.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>Roadmap summary</h4>
        <p class="muted small">How your business scales from launch through growth &mdash; plus your first tasks auto-added to your board.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:1rem">Launch blueprints are a paid feature. Free users can generate and browse ideas, then upgrade when ready.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 4</p>
    <h2>&#x1F3C3; Sprint into action</h2>
    <p class="muted">The blueprint doesn&rsquo;t sit in a drawer. NoBossly turns it into a 7-day sprint: a focused block of work with clear tasks, a theme, and a daily rhythm that keeps you moving.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Sprint auto-populated with <strong>prioritised tasks</strong> from your blueprint&rsquo;s week-one actions</li>
      <li>Full <strong>kanban task board</strong> &mdash; add tasks, set priorities, mark them done</li>
      <li><strong>Daily check-in</strong> earns +15 XP and extends your streak</li>
      <li><strong>Sprint velocity</strong> shows what percentage of tasks you completed</li>
      <li>When one sprint ends, start the next &mdash; each building on the last</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;align-self:center">
    <h4 style="margin:0 0 .4rem">&#x1F4CB; Sample sprint</h4>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:0 0 1rem">Theme: Landing page &amp; first lead &middot; 4 of 7 tasks done</p>
    <div class="progress" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><div class="progress-bar" style="width:57%"></div></div>
    <ul class="task-list" style="margin:0">
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>Register domain name</strong> <span class="tag tag-high">high</span></div></li>
      <li class="task done"><button class="task-check">&#x2713;</button><div><strong>Write the hero headline</strong> <span class="tag tag-high">high</span></div></li>
      <li class="task"><button class="task-check"></button><div><strong>Set up email capture form</strong> <span class="tag tag-medium">medium</span></div></li>
      <li class="task"><button class="task-check"></button><div><strong>Post in 3 relevant communities</strong> <span class="tag tag-medium">medium</span></div></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 5</p>
    <h2>&#x1F4C8; Level up as you build</h2>
    <p class="muted">Building a business is a long game. NoBossly makes the journey visible &mdash; XP, levels, streaks, milestones, and challenges turn consistent action into something you can actually see and measure.</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1rem">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x26A1; XP &amp; founder levels</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Earn XP for every task completed, daily check-in, milestone hit, and challenge finished. XP unlocks levels from Dreamer through Ideator, Builder, and beyond.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F525; Streaks</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Every day you check in extends your streak. Missing a day resets it. The streak counter on your dashboard is a simple, honest measure of consistency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F3DB;&#xFE0F; Milestones</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Six categories &mdash; Foundation, Product, Revenue, Traction, Community, and Personal &mdash; each with achievements to claim as you hit them. Paid plans unlock AI-tailored milestones built from your blueprint.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F3C1; Challenges</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Accept a 30, 60, or 90-day challenge and it pins to your dashboard. Paid plans unlock AI-generated challenges for your specific business. Earn XP and badges when you finish.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F3C5; Badges</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Complete major milestones and challenges to earn badges that show on your public profile &mdash; proof of real progress, not just participation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>&#x1F4CA; Progress analytics</h4>
        <p class="muted small">Your dashboard shows eight weeks of task completion and XP history so you can see which weeks you showed up and which ones you coasted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row">
  <div>
    <p class="hiw-step-label">Step 6</p>
    <h2>&#x1F310; Build with a community behind you</h2>
    <p class="muted">Solo founding is hard. NoBossly gives you a full community of founders at every stage &mdash; people who get it, because they&rsquo;re doing it too.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li><strong>Forum</strong> &mdash; post questions, share wins, get feedback on your idea or copy</li>
      <li><strong>Member directory</strong> &mdash; browse founders by XP and level; see bios, badges, and milestones</li>
      <li><strong>Direct messages</strong> &mdash; reach out to any member directly</li>
      <li><strong>Follow &amp; friends</strong> &mdash; follow founders you want to watch; send friend requests to connect closely</li>
      <li><strong>Collaborations</strong> (paid) &mdash; find co-founders, advisors, beta testers, and dev partners</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;align-self:center">
    <h4 style="margin:0 0 1rem">Your public profile</h4>
    <div class="profile-head" style="align-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem">
      <div class="avatar-circle">D</div>
      <div>
        <strong>Dillon Price</strong>
        <p class="muted small" style="margin:.2rem 0 0">&#x1F528; Level 3 &mdash; Builder &middot; &#x26A1; 325 XP</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin-bottom:.75rem">
      <span class="chip">&#x1F3C5; First Sprint</span>
      <span class="chip">&#x1F3C5; Launched</span>
      <span class="chip chip-success">&#x2705; Revenue: Day 1</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:0">Bootstrapping a geo-flexible job board. &#x1F525; 12-day streak.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="margin:3rem 0">
  <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:.5rem">Start free. Go deeper when you&rsquo;re ready.</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem">No credit card needed to start. Upgrade any time from your account settings.</p>
  <div class="pricing-grid">
    <div class="card price-card">
      <h3>Free</h3>
