        <li>&#10003; Collaborations &amp; teams</li>
        <li>&#10003; Budget tracker</li>
        <li>&#10003; Priority support</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-block" href="/pricing">See all plans</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <h2>Your boss isn&rsquo;t going to fire themselves.</h2>
  <p class="muted">Join NoBossly free and get your first AI-matched business ideas in under 10 minutes.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:1.1rem;display:inline-block" href="/signup">Get my business ideas &rarr;</a>
</section>

